cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts or data, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Solar Decomp consistency study: analysis scripts and derived data"
abstract: >
  Analysis scripts and derived data behind a study of how consistent the Erbs,
  Reindl-2 and DIRINT decomposition models are with the DNI and DHI fields of
  IWEC2 weather files for Argentina, with a limited comparison against ground
  measurements (BSRN, SURFRAD, SRRL and the INAHE station in Mendoza). Includes
  the one-minute global and diffuse series of the INAHE station in Mendoza
  (2022-2025). The IWEC2 files and the BSRN, SURFRAD and SRRL series are not
  redistributed; file lists and hashes are provided.
